BRAND TYPEFACE

Kensington Compressed Bold is proprietary to Slevomat and is deliberately not
included in this repository or redistributed with it.

The brand font token names Kensington first, so machines that already have the
font render the real brand face; everywhere else it falls back to Bebas Neue
automatically, with no configuration either way. See
packages/tokens/src/fonts/README.md.


